							<div class="col-12 col-lg-6"> 
								<div class="newsletter__contents"> 
									<h2>Equitable, sustainable, community-centered local news solutions</h2>
																		<a class="l-btn l-btn--secondary" href="https://www.lenfestinstitute.org/impact/">Our Impact</a>
